<div class="bde-f-text-506-151 bde-f-text">
<p>Jackson earns <strong>$49m</strong> in 2026-27, the largest salary at <a href="/teams/utah-jazz/">Utah</a> and the first year of a four-year extension. It rises from <strong>$35m</strong> last season.</p>
<p>His career earnings come to <strong>$194.59m</strong> across nine seasons. The salary is <strong>26.78%</strong> of the club’s <strong>$182.97m</strong> payroll, so more than a quarter of what Utah spends goes to one player.</p>

